    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/fa3013196ce5a467ce540c07ca552298.poster.avif?t=1750983199\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/fa3013196ce5a467ce540c07ca552298.webm?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/fa3013196ce5a467ce540c07ca552298.mp4?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What is Collect Baby Oil about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Baby Oil is a fast-paced runner where you have to run away from the police. Collect bottles of baby oil scattered along your path to unlock a variety of funny and unique characters such as Quandale Dingle. Avoid obstacles, time your jumps perfectly, and see how far you can go before the cops catch up.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Runner, endless fun</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect baby oil</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique characters such as Didi and Quandale Dingle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging obstacles that you have to avoid</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't Get Caught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/dfdeb355fb5d291b373da5738e01d9d2.poster.avif?t=1750983199\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/dfdeb355fb5d291b373da5738e01d9d2.webm?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/dfdeb355fb5d291b373da5738e01d9d2.mp4?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid obstacles to prevent falling and getting caught by the police.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/2b424f0020244af733747bfd20aa79ec.poster.avif?t=1750983199\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/2b424f0020244af733747bfd20aa79ec.webm?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/2b424f0020244af733747bfd20aa79ec.mp4?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are multiple characters that you can buy from collecting baby oil.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/fa3013196ce5a467ce540c07ca552298.poster.avif?t=1750983199\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/fa3013196ce5a467ce540c07ca552298.webm?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/fa3013196ce5a467ce540c07ca552298.mp4?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What is Collect Baby Oil about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Baby Oil is a fast-paced runner where you have to run away from the police. Collect bottles of baby oil scattered along your path to unlock a variety of funny and unique characters such as Quandale Dingle. Avoid obstacles, time your jumps perfectly, and see how far you can go before the cops catch up.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Runner, endless fun</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect baby oil</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique characters such as Didi and Quandale Dingle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging obstacles that you have to avoid</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't Get Caught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/dfdeb355fb5d291b373da5738e01d9d2.poster.avif?t=1750983199\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/dfdeb355fb5d291b373da5738e01d9d2.webm?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/dfdeb355fb5d291b373da5738e01d9d2.mp4?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid obstacles to prevent falling and getting caught by the police.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/2b424f0020244af733747bfd20aa79ec.poster.avif?t=1750983199\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/2b424f0020244af733747bfd20aa79ec.webm?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487490/extras/2b424f0020244af733747bfd20aa79ec.mp4?t=1750983199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are multiple characters that you can buy from collecting baby oil.</strong></p>",
